/* Garage catalog: maintenance items, warning lights, checklists. Keys are the English text. */
"Engine Oil" = "机油";
"Lubricates and cools the engine. Old oil thickens and wears parts faster." = "润滑并冷却发动机。机油老化变稠会加速零件磨损。";
"Synthetic oil often allows 7,500–10,000 km; follow the manual." = "全合成机油通常可用 7,500–10,000 公里，请以保养手册为准。";
"Check the dipstick monthly with the engine cold." = "每月在冷车状态下检查一次机油尺。";
"Short trips and city traffic count as severe use." = "短途行驶和城市拥堵属于恶劣工况。";
"Oil Filter" = "机油滤清器";
"Traps metal particles and sludge. Replace it with every oil change." = "拦截金属屑和油泥，每次换机油时一并更换。";
"Use a filter that matches the engine specification." = "选用与发动机规格匹配的机滤。";
"Lightly oil the new gasket before fitting." = "安装前在新密封圈上薄涂一层机油。";
"Engine Air Filter" = "空气滤清器";
"Keeps dust out of the engine. A clogged filter costs power and fuel." = "防止灰尘进入发动机，堵塞会导致动力下降、油耗升高。";
"Replace sooner in dusty or sandy areas." = "多尘或风沙地区应缩短更换周期。";
"Hold it up to light: if you can't see through it, replace it." = "对着光看，如果透不过光就该换了。";
"Cabin Air Filter" = "空调滤清器";
"Filters the air you breathe inside the car and keeps the A/C efficient." = "过滤车内呼吸的空气，并保持空调效率。";
"A musty smell from the vents is a sign it's due." = "出风口有霉味通常说明该换了。";
"Activated-carbon filters also reduce odors." = "活性炭滤芯还能减少异味。";
"Tire Rotation" = "轮胎换位";
"Moves tires between positions so they wear evenly and last longer." = "前后轮胎互换位置，使磨损均匀、延长寿命。";
"Check tread depth: replace below 1.6 mm, ideally at 3 mm." = "检查胎纹深度：低于 1.6 毫米必须更换，3 毫米时建议更换。";
"Good time to check for nails and sidewall cracks." = "顺便检查有无扎钉和胎侧裂纹。";
"Tire Pressure" = "胎压";
"Correct pressure improves grip, braking and fuel economy." = "正确的胎压能提升抓地力、制动性能和燃油经济性。";
"Use the pressure on the door-frame sticker, not the tire wall." = "以车门框标签上的胎压为准，而不是轮胎侧面的数值。";
"Check cold, before driving." = "在冷胎、行驶前测量。";
"Don't forget the spare." = "别忘了备胎。";
"Brake Pads" = "刹车片";
"Pads wear with every stop. Worn pads damage discs and lengthen braking distance." = "每次刹车都会磨损，过度磨损会伤及刹车盘并延长制动距离。";
"Squealing or grinding means inspect now." = "出现尖叫或摩擦声应立即检查。";
"Front pads usually wear twice as fast as rear." = "前刹车片的磨损速度通常是后刹车片的两倍。";
"Brake Fluid" = "刹车油";
"Brake fluid absorbs water over time, which lowers its boiling point." = "刹车油会逐渐吸收水分，导致沸点下降。";
"Replace every 2 years regardless of mileage." = "无论里程多少，每 2 年更换一次。";
"A soft pedal needs immediate attention." = "刹车踏板发软需要立即处理。";
"Coolant" = "冷却液";
"Prevents overheating in summer and freezing in winter." = "防止夏季过热、冬季结冰。";
"Never open the radiator cap when the engine is hot." = "发动机热车时切勿打开水箱盖。";
"Don't mix coolant types or colors." = "不同类型或颜色的冷却液不要混用。";
"Spark Plugs" = "火花塞";
"Ignite the fuel. Worn plugs cause rough idle, misfires and higher consumption." = "点燃燃油。火花塞老化会导致怠速抖动、失火和油耗升高。";
"Iridium plugs can last 80,000–100,000 km." = "铱金火花塞可用 80,000–100,000 公里。";
"Replace as a full set." = "需整套更换。";
"Transmission Fluid" = "变速箱油";
"Keeps gear changes smooth and protects the gearbox." = "保证换挡平顺，保护变速箱。";
"CVT and dual-clutch boxes have their own fluid type." = "CVT 和双离合变速箱需使用专用油液。";
"Delayed or harsh shifts are a warning sign." = "换挡迟滞或冲击是警示信号。";
"Battery Check" = "蓄电池检查";
"Most batteries last 3–5 years. Cold weather exposes weak ones." = "多数蓄电池寿命为 3–5 年，寒冷天气更容易暴露问题。";
"Slow cranking is the first symptom." = "启动无力是最早的症状。";
"Clean white or green corrosion from the terminals." = "清理电极桩头上白色或绿色的腐蚀物。";
"Wiper Blades" = "雨刮片";
"Rubber hardens in sun and cold, leaving streaks and reducing visibility." = "胶条在暴晒和严寒下会硬化，造成刮不净、视线变差。";
"Replace when they streak, chatter or skip." = "出现划痕、抖动或跳刮时更换。";
"Top up washer fluid at the same time." = "顺便加满玻璃水。";
"Wheel Alignment" = "四轮定位";
"Keeps the car tracking straight and prevents uneven tire wear." = "让车辆保持直线行驶，防止轮胎偏磨。";
"Check after hitting a big pothole or curb." = "撞到大坑或路肩后应检查。";
"A pulling car or off-center steering wheel means check now." = "跑偏或方向盘不正需要立即检查。";
"Timing Belt" = "正时皮带";
"Synchronizes the engine. A broken belt can destroy the engine." = "同步发动机运转，断裂可能导致发动机严重损坏。";
"Some engines use a chain that rarely needs replacing; check the manual." = "部分发动机采用正时链条，很少需要更换，请查阅保养手册。";
"Replace the water pump at the same time if driven by the belt." = "如果水泵由皮带驱动，建议一并更换。";
"A/C Service" = "空调保养";
"Checks refrigerant, cleans the evaporator and keeps the cooling strong." = "检查冷媒、清洗蒸发箱，保持制冷效果。";
"Run the A/C a few minutes every month, even in winter." = "即使在冬天，也每月开几分钟空调。";
"Weak cooling usually means a refrigerant leak." = "制冷变弱通常意味着冷媒泄漏。";
"Fuel Filter" = "燃油滤清器";
"Protects injectors from dirt in the fuel. Especially important for diesel." = "防止燃油中的杂质进入喷油嘴，柴油车尤为重要。";
"Many modern gasoline cars have an in-tank filter." = "许多新款汽油车采用油箱内置滤芯。";
"Diesel filters also separate water." = "柴油滤清器还能分离水分。";
"Suspension Check" = "悬挂检查";
"Shock absorbers and bushings keep the tires on the road." = "减震器和衬套让轮胎紧贴路面。";
"Bouncy ride or nose-dive under braking means worn shocks." = "行驶颠簸、刹车点头说明减震器老化。";
"Listen for knocks over speed bumps." = "留意过减速带时有无异响。";
"Engine Oil Pressure" = "机油压力";
"Oil pressure is too low to protect the engine." = "机油压力过低，无法保护发动机。";
"Stop as soon as it's safe and turn off the engine. Check the oil level; do not drive until fixed." = "尽快在安全处停车并熄火，检查机油液位；修好前不要继续行驶。";
"Engine Temperature" = "发动机水温";
"The engine is overheating." = "发动机过热。";
"Pull over, switch off the engine and let it cool. Never open the radiator cap while hot." = "靠边停车、熄火冷却。热车时切勿打开水箱盖。";
"Brake System" = "制动系统";
"Parking brake is on, brake fluid is low or the system has a fault." = "手刹未松、刹车油不足或制动系统故障。";
"Release the parking brake. If the light stays on, drive carefully to a workshop or call for help." = "先松开手刹。如果灯仍亮，谨慎驾驶到修理厂或呼叫救援。";
"Battery / Charging" = "蓄电池/充电";
"The alternator is not charging the battery." = "发电机没有给蓄电池充电。";
"Turn off non-essential electrics and drive straight to a workshop; the car may stop soon." = "关闭不必要的用电设备，直接开往修理厂，车辆可能很快熄火。";
"Airbag" = "安全气囊";
"The airbag system has a fault and may not deploy." = "气囊系统故障，碰撞时可能无法弹出。";
"Have it checked soon. Don't fit a child seat in front of an airbag." = "尽快检查。不要在有气囊的座位前安装儿童座椅。";
"Check Engine" = "发动机故障";
"The engine computer detected an emissions or engine fault." = "发动机电脑检测到排放或发动机故障。";
"Steady: book a check soon. Flashing: reduce speed and get it checked immediately." = "常亮：尽快预约检查。闪烁：降低车速并立即检查。";
"ABS" = "ABS";
"Anti-lock braking is disabled. Normal brakes still work." = "防抱死系统已停用，普通制动仍然有效。";
"Brake gently and leave extra distance. Get it checked soon." = "轻踩刹车并加大跟车距离，尽快检查。";
"Tire Pressure (TPMS)" = "胎压监测";
"One or more tires are under-inflated." = "一个或多个轮胎胎压不足。";
"Check all tires and inflate to the recommended pressure. Look for punctures." = "检查所有轮胎并充气到推荐胎压，留意是否扎钉。";
"Traction / Stability Control" = "牵引力/车身稳定系统";
"Flashing: the system is working on a slippery road. Steady: it is off or faulty." = "闪烁：系统正在湿滑路面上工作。常亮：系统已关闭或故障。";
"Drive smoothly. If steady and you didn't switch it off, have it checked." = "平稳驾驶。如果常亮且你没有手动关闭，请检查。";
"Low Fuel" = "燃油不足";
"The fuel reserve is being used." = "已开始使用备用油量。";
"Refuel soon. Running dry can damage the fuel pump." = "尽快加油，油箱烧干可能损坏油泵。";
"Washer Fluid" = "玻璃水不足";
"Windshield washer fluid is low." = "风挡玻璃清洗液不足。";
"Top up with washer fluid; use a winter mix below freezing." = "加注玻璃水；气温低于冰点时使用防冻型。";
"Glow Plug (Diesel)" = "预热塞（柴油）";
"Diesel glow plugs are pre-heating." = "柴油车预热塞正在预热。";
"Wait until it goes out before starting. If it flashes while driving, get it checked." = "等指示灯熄灭后再启动。如果行驶中闪烁，请检查。";
"Before a Road Trip" = "长途出行前";
"A 15-minute check before a long drive." = "长途驾驶前 15 分钟的检查。";
"Check tire pressure and tread, including the spare" = "检查胎压和胎纹，包括备胎";
"Check engine oil and coolant levels" = "检查机油和冷却液液位";
"Test all lights and indicators" = "检查所有灯光和转向灯";
"Top up washer fluid" = "加满玻璃水";
"Check wiper blades" = "检查雨刮片";
"Pack warning triangle and first-aid kit" = "备好三角警示牌和急救包";
"Check insurance and roadside assistance details" = "确认保险和道路救援信息";
"Winter Ready" = "冬季准备";
"Prepare the car before the first frost." = "初霜前做好准备。";
"Test the battery" = "检测蓄电池";
"Check coolant antifreeze strength" = "检查冷却液冰点";
"Switch to winter washer fluid" = "换用防冻玻璃水";
"Consider winter tires" = "考虑换装冬季胎";
"Replace worn wiper blades" = "更换老化的雨刮片";
"Pack scraper, gloves and a blanket" = "备好除霜铲、手套和毯子";
"Summer Ready" = "夏季准备";
"Before the hot season." = "炎热季节到来前。";
"Check A/C cooling" = "检查空调制冷";
"Check coolant level and hoses" = "检查冷却液液位和水管";
"Check tire pressure (heat raises it)" = "检查胎压（高温会使胎压升高）";
"Clean the cabin air filter" = "清洁空调滤清器";
"Monthly Quick Check" = "每月快速检查";
"Five minutes, once a month." = "每月一次，五分钟。";
"Tire pressure" = "胎压";
"Engine oil level" = "机油液位";
"Washer fluid" = "玻璃水";
"Lights and indicators" = "灯光和转向灯";
"Look under the car for leaks" = "看看车底有无漏液";
"Used Car Inspection" = "二手车验车";
"When buying a second-hand car." = "购买二手车时。";
"Check service history and receipts" = "查看保养记录和发票";
"Compare odometer with records" = "核对里程表与记录是否一致";
"Look for uneven panel gaps and paint" = "检查漆面和钣金缝隙是否均匀";
"Cold-start the engine and listen" = "冷车启动并听发动机声音";
"Test drive on different roads" = "在不同路况下试驾";
"Check all warning lights go out after start" = "确认启动后所有故障灯熄灭";
"Verify VIN matches documents" = "核对车架号与证件一致";
